{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/w8muni","slide":3,"text":"This is the implementation split. The Anchor program is the control plane; it owns escrow and approved state. The local agent is the execution plane; it holds browser state and touches merchant systems. JSON evidence and hashes bridge the two. Sensitive data never crosses into Solana.\n\n[Sources]\n- Anchor program and generated IDL in the repository\n- agent/src adapter runner and browser modules\n- agent/out/chain-job.json"}
