{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/tb0lq0","slide":11,"text":"Close on the protocol, not the delivery app. The value is a reusable authorization and proof layer for physical commerce. Wolt, Glovo, local print, or a human operator can all be adapters without changing the core contract.\n\n[Sources]\n- Repository README talk track\n- Local demo evidence under agent/out/"}